# W4 `/compact` over two text-only turns: nothing but the exact message and
# reply to keep, so neither product asks the model for notes; the next
# request carries the compacted form of the first turn.
gateway compact-text-turns.json
wait 3
type first question
key Enter
wait 2.5
type second question
key Enter
wait 2.5
type /compact
key Enter
wait 0.4
snap compacted
type third question
key Enter
wait 2.5
snap next-turn
gwlog
